WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.719
In this video, you will judge a contest.

00:00:02.719 --> 00:00:10.299
You will open your invitation email, see how your ballot works, and score the homes, including what to do when you know the household.

00:00:11.202 --> 00:00:13.237
This is your invitation email.

00:00:13.237 --> 00:00:17.766
It says which contest it is, who invited you, and how judging works.

00:00:17.766 --> 00:00:20.523
Everything you need is behind one button.

00:00:20.523 --> 00:00:22.295
Tap Open my judges' ballot.

00:00:25.063 --> 00:00:26.326
This is your ballot.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:33.121
It says when voting closes, and how many scores you have given so far, so you always know how far along you are.

00:00:33.121 --> 00:00:37.330
Your scores stay private, and you can change them until voting closes.

00:00:38.235 --> 00:00:41.422
Before you score, you may want to see the homes in person.

00:00:41.422 --> 00:00:42.502
Tap Visit the homes.

00:00:44.206 --> 00:00:49.787
A long list is split into routes of nine stops or fewer, and each one opens in your maps app.

00:00:49.787 --> 00:00:54.596
Each route starts where the last one ended, and you tick off each home as you go.

00:00:55.507 --> 00:00:56.851
Now tap a category.

00:00:58.717 --> 00:01:03.325
Every home is in every category, so you will score each home once for each award.

00:01:04.229 --> 00:01:07.487
Do you know the household, perhaps a friend or a relative?

00:01:07.487 --> 00:01:08.922
Tap I know this household.

00:01:10.657 --> 00:01:14.369
That home is skipped for you, so your score cannot be questioned later.

00:01:15.274 --> 00:01:18.351
Score each of the other homes from one to ten.

00:01:18.351 --> 00:01:23.786
Judge on first impression, creativity, theme, craftsmanship, and variety of lights.

00:01:24.686 --> 00:01:26.435
Tap Ballot to see your progress.

00:01:28.184 --> 00:01:30.565
When you have scored every home, you are done.

00:01:30.565 --> 00:01:33.453
Your scores stay private until the winners are announced.

00:01:34.358 --> 00:01:36.896
Next up: Create a contest in two minutes.
